  "solution": "**Given Equation: **15 × 3 ÷ 15 – (45 × 3) – 10 + (13 ÷ 2) = 76\n\n**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option One by One:\n\n**Option 1) ÷ and ×**\n\nGiven: 15 × 3 ÷ 15 – (45 × 3) – 10 + (13 ÷ 2) = 76\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n15 ÷ 3 ×15 – __**(45 ÷ 3) **__ – 10 + __**(13 × 2)**__ = 76\n\n__**15 ÷ 3**__ ×15 – 15 – 10 + 26 = 76\n\n__**5 ×15**__ – 15 – 10 + 26 = 76\n\n__**75**__ – 15 – 10 __**+ 26**__ = 76\n\n101 - 15</strong&g",
